    "detailed_description": "Halberta is a platforming puzzle game where you must escape several rooms. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nUsing the recently discovered Force Manipulator Prototype, Halberta will seemingly be able to rotate the rooms, allowing her to move the platforms into desirable positions and reach new heights, or bring the exit closer for an easy escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTime freezes while rotating, so don't be afraid to take your time looking at the different possible paths as you rotate the room!",
